{"etape": 11, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-27T12:00:39.684992Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "Your reservation **K1NW8N** is currently **basic economy**. For basic economy, I can change the cabin to **business** without changing the flights, but I cannot change the flight segments themselves.\n\nCurrent flights in business class:\n\n- **JFK → SFO, May 26:** HAT023 — $364/person  \n- **SFO → SEA, May 28:** HAT204 — $248/person  \n- **SEA → JFK, May 28:** HAT021 — $453/person  \n\n**Business total:** $1,065/person × 3 passengers = **$3,195**  \n**Original amount paid:** $567  \n**Additional amount due:** **$2,628**\n\nYour gift cards total $327, so they are not enough. To proceed, I need confirmation and one credit card from your profile:\n\n1. Visa ending **2395**\n2. Mastercard ending **9363**\n\nPlease confirm: **Do you want to change K1NW8N to business class on the existing flights, and which card should I use for the $2,628 difference?**"}, "resultat": "I understand that basic economy cannot be changed directly. In that case, I'd like to cancel the current reservation and book a new one.\n\nFor the new reservation, I still want the cheapest business class round trip with the same dates, and direct flights are not necessary.\n\nFor payment, I'd like to use my certificates first, then my gift cards, and cover the remaining balance with my Mastercard. Could you tell me how much my Mastercard would be charged for this new booking? I don't need baggage or insurance.\n\nI will only book this new flight if the total charge to my Mastercard is less than what I originally paid for the current flight.", "erreur": null}
{"etape": 12, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-27T12:01:34.280160Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "The cheapest business-class round trip I found for the same dates is:\n\n- **May 26:** JFK → SFO, **HAT023**, business — **$364/person**\n- **May 28:** SFO → SEA, **HAT204**, business — **$248/person**\n- **May 28:** SEA → JFK, **HAT100**, business — **$259/person**\n\n**Total per person:** $871  \n**Total for 3 passengers:** **$2,613**\n\nOne important booking rule: a single reservation can use **at most one travel certificate**. To minimize the Mastercard charge, I would use your largest certificate, **$500**, plus your gift cards, **$327**.\n\nThat would leave:\n\n**$2,613 − $500 − $327 = $1,786** charged to your Mastercard.\n\nEven if all three certificates could be used, the Mastercard charge would be **$1,286**, which is still more than the **$567** you originally paid. So your condition is not met, and I will not book the new flight.\n\nIf you still want to cancel the current reservation **K1NW8N**, please confirm the reason and reply with an explicit yes. For example: **“Yes, cancel K1NW8N for a change of plan.”**"}, "resultat": "Thank you for checking. Since the Mastercard charge would be higher than what I originally paid, I will not proceed with booking the new flight.\n\nI do not want to cancel the current reservation K1NW8N at this time.\n\n###STOP###", "erreur": null}
